 "q03_q11": "NOT two payable floor quantities. Same physical surface (the three BATH sites, 17.7425 m2) but historically two DIFFERENT trades: Q-03 = wet-area WATERPROOFING floor, Q-11 = wet-room CERAMIC floor. The R8.18 waterproofing register now owns the membrane (WATERPROOFING_FLOOR_M2), so RC1: Q-11 -> canonical FLOOR CERAMIC WET item; Q-03 -> LEGACY alias of the bathroom part of the canonical WATERPROOFING FLOOR item (and it must never again be shown as a floor-finish row)",
 "q03p_q12": "Same: Q-12 -> canonical PAINTRY CERAMIC FLOOR item; Q-03P -> legacy alias of the PAINTRY part of the WATERPROOFING FLOOR item",
 "r8_20_xlsx_duplicate_risk": "YES (R8.20 XLSX): 01_BOQ_SUMMARY lists Q-03, Q-03P, Q-11, Q-12 and Q-13 all as ARCHITECTURAL_FLOOR_FINISH (sum 170.7538 m2 against a physical floor of 141.8363 m2) AND WATERPROOFING-FLOOR 29.4275 - the membrane appears twice and the wet / service floor twice. Also MARBLE plan area (m2) and MARBLE length (lm) are two measures of the SAME four thresholds (price one basis). This is a reporting defect (quantities unchanged); RC1 removes it structurally",
 "r8_20_floor_lines_sum_m2": 170.7538,
